Title: The Last Bus
Author: Rough Cut release run

EXT. COUNTRY ROAD BUS STOP - NIGHT

Rain drums on a tin shelter. RUTH, an older woman in a yellow raincoat, checks her watch under a flickering lamp.

RUTH
Late again.

EXT. COUNTRY ROAD - NIGHT

Headlights swell through the rain. An old green bus rattles to a stop.

INT. BUS - NIGHT

The driver, SAM, a young man with a kind face, opens the door and smiles.

SAM
Last one tonight.

RUTH
I know. I waited.

INT. BUS - LATER

Ruth takes the front seat. Through the fogged window, the village lights come into view.

SAM
Home soon.

RUTH
Home soon.
